# --- Generated artifacts ---------------------------------------------------
# reports/ and data/raw/ ARE committed: the raw CSV (~950 KB, IBM's public
# fictional sample) keeps the project reproducible offline, and the tables,
# figures and reports are the evidence behind every number in the README.
#
# These two are excluded because they are large, derivable in ~20 s by
# `python scripts/run_pipeline.py`, and (for the model) fragile across
# scikit-learn versions:
data/processed/*.csv
models/*.joblib
!**/.gitkeep
